      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.31,
      "end_seconds": 3.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "Hello there. Please, sit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.69,
      "end_seconds": 7.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Hello, doctor, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.53,
      "end_seconds": 10.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "Alright, was parking alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.4,
      "end_seconds": 18.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.97,
      "text": "Not great, I ended up a few streets away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.5,
      "end_seconds": 22.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Go ahead, tell me what's happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.21,
      "end_seconds": 31.81,
      "duration_seconds": 8.6,
      "text": "I've been getting lost on familiar roads. I took the morning off to come in today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.71,
      "end_seconds": 36.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Since when have you had this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.46,
      "end_seconds": 40.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "I've had it for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.01,
      "end_seconds": 44.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "Have you been repeating the same questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.48,
      "end_seconds": 49.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "Oh, yeah. Two months, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.39,
      "end_seconds": 54.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.22,
      "end_seconds": 59.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "No, nothing, I've generally been healthy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.63,
      "end_seconds": 70.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.82,
      "end_seconds": 85.95,
      "duration_seconds": 14.13,
      "text": "I walk for about half an hour most days. I try to avoid too much sugar. I'm a software engineer, so I'm at a screen all day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.82,
      "end_seconds": 99.02,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.19,
      "end_seconds": 101.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "No allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.71,
      "end_seconds": 104.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Are you on any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.62,
      "end_seconds": 106.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.01,
      "text": "Nothing, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.29,
      "end_seconds": 109.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.54,
      "end_seconds": 112.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "No operations, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.25,
      "end_seconds": 118.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.19,
      "text": "Did you get low mood, hallucinations or trouble with bladder control?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.02,
      "end_seconds": 125.56,
      "duration_seconds": 6.54,
      "text": "Uh, no, no low mood, hallucinations or trouble with bladder control."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.61,
      "end_seconds": 130.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "Any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.02,
      "end_seconds": 133.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "No, my breathing's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.85,
      "end_seconds": 143.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "I'll take a few measurements first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.06,
      "end_seconds": 156.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Hold still for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.5,
      "end_seconds": 193.12,
      "duration_seconds": 15.62,
      "text": "Okay: weight 81 kilos, pulse is 66 beats a minute, temperature is 36.6 degrees, BMI works out to 30.1, saturation 97 percent, height 164 centimetres, pressure 114 over 81."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.33,
      "end_seconds": 195.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.38,
      "end_seconds": 200.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Let's look at it together in a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.96,
      "end_seconds": 229.82,
      "duration_seconds": 12.86,
      "text": "So, based on your history, this looks most like memory difficulties that need to be worked up. The reason I say that is that the way you describe it fits together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 230.53,
      "end_seconds": 233.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "So, do you think it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.59,
      "end_seconds": 270.19,
      "duration_seconds": 35.6,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now memory difficulties that need to be worked up is my leading thought, not anything worse. I'm sending you for a CT scan of the head because of memory loss. I think a thyroid test makes sense here, for memory loss. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. Keep a daily routine and write things down, a notebook by the door works well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.16,
      "end_seconds": 296.11,
      "duration_seconds": 23.95,
      "text": "I'll also refer you to the memory clinic. I'm not ordering a vitamin B12 level today. If things carry on next month, we'll consider it. Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency. I'll want another look in four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.01,
      "end_seconds": 299.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Good, I'll come back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.96,
      "end_seconds": 303.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Call the clinic if you need us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 304.68,
      "end_seconds": 308.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "No, you've explained it well. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.25,
      "end_seconds": 310.16,
      "duration_seconds": 0.91,
      "text": "Take care."
    }
  ]
